  "notes": "The main Branicki Palace exterior and both connected forecourt wings in Białystok in summer 2023. Includes the baroque garden façade, twin courtyard pavilions, entry portico and open forecourt between the mapped wings. Detached gate, gardens and interior rooms are outside this model. Current mapped ground plan, courtyard approach and original imagery locate the permanent exterior. Roof sections and carved ornament are proportional estimates."
